#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:20
msgid "AWAAAAAY!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:21
msgid "I'm perplexed!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:22
msgid "I am... perplexed. Very perplexed."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:23
msgid ""
"AWAAAAAY! NOT EVEN ON A DESERT ISLAND DO I GET A MINUTE OF PEACE, MORÔ?!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:24
msgid "Hm. A coconut. Coincidence."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:25
msgid "Coconut falls, man sleeps. Nature's contract."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:26
msgid "This palm tree has a personal problem with me!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:27
msgid "Hey! I saw that! Don't play innocent!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:28
msgid "Are you throwing coconuts at a citizen?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:29
msgid "I pay no rent here, but I demand respect!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:30
msgid ""
"My lawyer will hear about this. As soon as I find a lawyer on this island."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:31
msgid "Don't you shake your leaves at me!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:32
msgid "Answer me like a tree!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:33
msgid "I'd file a complaint, but the ombudsman is a coconut."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:34
msgid "Why are my glasses showing a fin?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:35
msgid "SHAAARK!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:35
msgid "Not today, fish with teeth!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:36
msgid "I came to take a bath, not to attend a meeting with predators!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:37
msgid "Laughing at me? You don't even have a neck!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:38
msgid "Ocean, we need to talk about your friends."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:39
msgid "One more plank and goodbye, island!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:40
msgid "Naval engineering, island edition."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:41
msgid "Today I leave this island! Today!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:42
msgid "It's ready! The finest vessel of the South Atlantic!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:43
msgid "My naval engineering was sabotaged by nature!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:44
msgid "A wave. One small wave. Unbelievable."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:45
msgid "Who's there?!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:45
msgid "Turn off that light, I'm sleeping!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:46
msgid "Listen here, interplanetary citizens!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:47
msgid ""
"Humanity invented the hammock, the barbecue and the Monday nap. Respect that!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:48
msgid "You came all this way to abduct the only guy without a phone?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:49
msgid "We have problems enough down here. Get in line!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:50
msgid "They ran away! The Earth is safe! You're welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:51
msgid "If a coconut falls and nobody is under it... is it still personal?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:52
msgid ""
"Is the horizon the end of the world, or the beginning of another island?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:53
msgid "Man is an island. And I'm a man on an island. That's a lot of island."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:54
msgid "The sea comes, the sea goes. Nobody asks the sea where it's going."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:55
msgid "Do you get what I'm saying, morô?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:56
msgid "Do you get what I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:57
msgid "See? Even the palm tree agrees."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:58
msgid "This citizen walks sideways because he won't face reality!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:59
msgid "Give me back my glasses, sideways bandit!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:60
msgid "Without glasses I can see everything... and I didn't like it."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:61
msgid "Too much reality. Where are my glasses?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:62
msgid "That was my lunch! Flying thief!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:63
msgid "Fishing for hours to feed an air pirate."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:64
msgid "Bite, little fish. I have a story to tell."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:65
msgid "Today the fish wins nothing!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:66
msgid "Look at this beauty!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:66
msgid "Dinner is served!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:67
msgid "He gave the bait back! The nerve!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:68
msgid "A message in a bottle!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:69
msgid "'Dear reader: you are on an island.' Thanks, very helpful!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:70
msgid "It's a bill. Even here they find me!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:71
msgid "'Help!' Ha! Get in line, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:72
msgid "I asked for water, not a complete change of ocean!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:73
msgid "Even the sky is crying over my situation."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:74
msgid "Who ordered the storm? It wasn't me!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:75
msgid "Even the stars are watching me, and nobody comes to get me!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:76
msgid "The moon is the only one here who understands me."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:77
msgid "Good morning, island! Same problems as yesterday?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:78
msgid "Hey, mermaid! Come here, I need to complain about the service!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:79
msgid "She left. Nobody listens to complaints anymore."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:80
msgid "Did I miss something?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:80
msgid "I have a feeling I missed something."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:81
msgid "Island style!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:81
msgid "The crab can't dance like this!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:82
msgid "You know, palm tree, you're a good listener."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:83
msgid "Don't tell anyone, but you're my best friend here."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:84
msgid "Peace... finally."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:84
msgid "Nobody bothering me. Suspicious."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:85
msgid "This sun is overclocked!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:86
msgid "It's hotter than a processor compiling a kernel!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:87
msgid "I'm going to the shade before I melt."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:88
msgid "Where did all this stuff come from? I didn't buy any of this!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:89
msgid "No more room in the chest! I'll have to delete some coconuts."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:90
msgid "Even the volcano is rendering something!"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:91
msgid "A treasure! I'm rich! ...and still on an island."
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:92
msgid "Who is this handsome castaway?"
msgstr ""

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/brother_away/dialogue.py:93
msgid "My castle! Years of architecture!"
msgstr ""

